  {
    "name": "skyblock_profile_section",
    "title": "SkyBlock profile section",
    "description": "Read one detailed section, with optional separately sourced client observations for stats, currencies, equipment, minions and Garden: stats (API-reported Booster Cookie status, active/paused potion effects and coverage; dedicated God Potion status and cookie/God Potion timers remain unknown in the API; separately sourced client observations may provide displayed values), skills, currencies, slayers, dungeons (effective levels, XP progress and next normal floor level gate), pets (calculated levels and progress to their species cap, including level 200 dragons), collections, minions, equipment (gear, modern armor/equipment loadout sets, storage, backpacks by container, sacks and partial Huntaxe stored-weapon name/stars from item lore, expanded upgrade attributes, stable hashed item instance IDs and fieldCoverage reasons), accessories (calculated magical power, duplicates, upgrades, bonuses, power and tuning), garden (milestones, crops, plots, visitors, composter and player-specific Greenhouse discovered/analyzed mutations), mining (HotM XP/tier/tree, reported powder counters and forge evidence), foraging (HotF XP/tier/tree and whispers), hunting (shards, traps and attribute evidence), dailies (reported activity evidence; unverified resets/completions stay unknown), quests (objectives, unlocks and Guide evidence), rift, crimson_isle, chocolate_factory, and systems (factual coverage registry). New systems are partial: pinned node definitions and supported costs/effects are provided; unsupported formulas, effective attribute levels and undocumented balances stay unknown. No stored goals, preferences, recommendation engine or player history. Additional sections fishing, bestiary, travel, profile_upgrades, events, orders, museum, storage, api_fields and data_contract retain source facts and explicit unknown semantics. Default cached reads never refresh existing player snapshots; request snapshot mode only for an occasional explicit API check. Lists are paginated; inspect pagination and request more offsets. Potion duration ticks are saved API values, not a live countdown. Garden and Greenhouse have distinct snapshot sources. Missing backpacks or mutation lists are unknown. No live Greenhouse growth simulation. Minions report crafted unlocks. Does not perform gameplay or track histories.",
